  "_about": "iX Cluster's GT3, adapted from Cluster Themes' GT3 race dash: 18 round lights and a segmented bar across the top fill with battery power on a labelled display scale (eDrive blue while recuperating; no shift point on an EV), the selector huge in the middle, readout boxes either side (speed, power, charge, range, clock by default, changeable on the Readouts tab) and the peak power since the last 0-60 run. With the Waze map up the selector, battery temperature and charge move into the side boxes.",
